<!-- Composed CapaProblem in immediate mode with per-term targeted feedback.
     Selecting a labeled segment (|solar, |coal, ...) surfaces its note; the
     decoy <<...>> terms subtract from the score. -->
<CapaProblem id="feedback_energy" grade="immediate">
  <TextSelectionGrader>
    <TextSelectionInput>
Identify examples of renewable energy sources:
---
Power can come from [solar panels|solar], &lt;&lt;coal plants|coal&gt;&gt;, [wind turbines|wind], or &lt;&lt;natural gas|gas&gt;&gt;.
---
---
solar: Correct! Solar energy is renewable - the sun keeps shining.
wind: Right! Wind is a renewable resource.
coal: Not quite - coal is a fossil fuel that takes millions of years to form.
gas: Natural gas is also a fossil fuel, not renewable.
    </TextSelectionInput>
  </TextSelectionGrader>
</CapaProblem>
